        },
        {
          "text": "Elisa aramwishura, ati Ni mwumve ijambo ry’Uhoraho: uku ni k’Uhoraho agize, ngw Ejo nk’aya mango, kw irembo ry’i Samariya, ingero y’ifu igogōretse izogurwa shekeli imwe, kandi n’ ingero zibiri za sayiri zizogurwa shekeli imwe nyene. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.7.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.7.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
